# FluentCI documentation

> Guides and reference for FluentCI: a programmable CI/CD CLI, embedded Wasm engine, language SDKs, local Studio, desktop app, and AT Protocol plugin registry.

Install with `curl -fsSL https://cli.fluentci.io | sh`. Local execution requires no account. Source plugin compilation needs its language toolchain. The unified CLI is separate from engine-only command examples.

